WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.979
- Go!
(mjolnir banging)

00:00:00.979 --> 00:00:03.759
(shouting, bickering)

00:00:03.759 --> 00:00:04.990
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:06.640
Bad idea, we'll go one at a time.

00:00:07.504 --> 00:00:08.680
It's finally here.

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:10.350
Infinity War is in theaters,

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:11.790
and we get to see all of our favorite

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:13.983
Marvel superheroes back on screen,

00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:15.520
but this begs the question,

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:17.510
who's the best Avenger?

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:25.160
All right, so now we have six Marvel superfans

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:26.830
who are here to argue their case

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:28.260
^for their favorite Marvel Avengers.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:31.543
^- I'm Destinee, and I'm here to fight for the Black Panther.

00:00:31.771 --> 00:00:32.763
^Wakanda Forever.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:35.233
- Blip, blip, blip, blip.

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:36.163
^I'm Kris.

00:00:36.163 --> 00:00:37.320
^I'm representing Spiderman.

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:39.840
^- I'm Evan, and I'm fighting for Captain America.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:40.680
^- I'm Gadiel Del Orbe.

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:42.500
^I'm here to represent Doctor Strange,

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.153
^'cause he has cool hand signs.

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:45.293
^- I'm Brenden.

00:00:45.293 --> 00:00:46.380
^I'm here to rep Iron Man,

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:47.650
^'cause he's not just a superhero.

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:50.363
^He's also a billionaire playboy philanthropist.

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:51.413
^- Hi, I'm Michelle Feng.

00:00:51.413 --> 00:00:52.483
^I'm here for Team Thor.

00:00:52.690 --> 00:00:54.440
- First off, his (beep) spiderwebs!

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:55.400
Wait, can I cuss?

00:00:55.517 --> 00:00:57.720
(raucous laughter)

00:00:57.720 --> 00:00:59.337
- We have to establish some rules first here people.

00:00:59.337 --> 00:01:02.913
You can not talk unless you have the hammer in your hand.

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:03.947
Let's do this!

00:01:03.947 --> 00:01:05.862
(dramatic orchestral sting)

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:06.753
- Thank you.

00:01:06.753 --> 00:01:08.460
First of all, Black Panther is great.

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:09.770
I love Black Panther.

00:01:09.850 --> 00:01:11.720
My argument for Tony Stark, for Iron Man,

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:14.663
^is that there are no Avengers without Tony Stark.

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:16.830
Thor, or even a Black Panther, where some of his abilities

00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:18.600
are obviously like mystically infused,

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:19.883
he's a lot more fragile.

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:21.860
Tony Stark is just a dude, and look

00:01:21.860 --> 00:01:23.560
what he's been able to accomplish.

00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:25.350
He can make the people around him better.

00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:27.400
You can have ten random people in a room,

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:29.600
and Tony Stark can make them ten superheroes.

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:31.470
Any other Avenger can't really do that.

00:01:31.470 --> 00:01:33.470
- And now to Destinee for Black Panther.

00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:34.830
- For the culture.

00:01:35.131 --> 00:01:37.298
(yelling)

00:01:38.681 --> 00:01:41.870
^(smooth elevator music)

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:44.760
The reason why Black Panther, T'Challa, King T'Challa,

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:47.680
as you will address him, is the best Avenger

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:50.030
^is because, where did Infinity Wars take place?

00:01:50.484 --> 00:01:51.317
^Wakanda!

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:52.793
He has vibranium.

00:01:52.930 --> 00:01:56.183
There is no saving the world without vibranium.

00:01:56.430 --> 00:01:57.770
Iron Man is very selfish.

00:01:57.770 --> 00:02:00.063
What in that makes a great leader?

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:01.950
^Where did Cap get his shield from?

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:04.380
- Okay, so the shield's vibranium, you said earlier

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:07.030
that, "Oh, you can't save the world without vibranium",

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:09.510
I saw Infinity War, did vibranium save the world?

00:02:09.510 --> 00:02:10.560
I don't think it did.

00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:15.020
- The reason why Thor is the best Avenger

00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:18.000
^is not only does he have the most incredible power,

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:19.410
^he is a great person.

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:21.740
^He started off, he was selfish, he was banished

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:23.330
^because he was so self-centered.

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:26.190
Over the course of the MCU, you see him really developing

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:29.410
humanity and fighting not only for people on Asgard

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:30.770
but also the people of Earth.

00:02:30.770 --> 00:02:32.560
- Good person points for our Avengers.

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:33.750
It goes a long way people.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:35.880
- Spiderman has to be one of the most courageous Avengers.

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:37.383
Homeboy is 16 years old.

00:02:37.410 --> 00:02:38.243
- Wasn't he 17?

00:02:38.653 --> 00:02:39.840
Last time I checked.

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:42.500
- You can only speak when you have the power of the hammer!

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:43.333
- Okay.

00:02:43.333 --> 00:02:45.040
- How ever old he is, he's always rushing into the fight,

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:46.430
he's always out there to help.

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:48.829
^In Infinity War, he jumps on that spaceship,

00:02:48.829 --> 00:02:51.973
^goes with that spaceship, he also becomes the Iron Spider,

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:54.480
basically makes a plan to kill one of the Black Order.

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:56.730
He's doing way more than I was as a teenager.

00:02:56.746 --> 00:02:58.168
- That's not saying much though, kids.

00:02:58.168 --> 00:02:59.793
(laughter)

00:02:59.793 --> 00:03:02.260
- He's the best Avenger because he has the most to prove,

00:03:02.260 --> 00:03:05.393
and he proves it every single step of the way.

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:09.923
- Captain America is technically the first Avenger.

00:03:09.990 --> 00:03:12.923
He was the first one to band everyone together,

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:17.023
^also he's the only one who can actually hold Thor's hammer,

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:18.863
^because he is all pure.

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:21.730
^He's a little kid who got some power and now he uses it

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:23.130
to make the world a better place.

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:25.740
- First of all, Captain America betrayed the Avengers

00:03:25.740 --> 00:03:28.620
just because, "Bucky is my friend from back in the day."

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:30.980
And where was Captain America at the beginning of the movie?

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:32.080
You know where was he?

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:33.967
He was licking Bucky's ass.

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:37.093
^All Dr. Strange is gotta do is, "Hey Captain America,

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:39.790
^we're going to teleport to Uranus and leave him there."

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:41.603
He has magic, he could multiply.

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:43.350
Captain America wouldn't know what to do.

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:45.180
- Dr. Strange wouldn't have his powers

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:46.880
if it weren't for Captain America.

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:48.870
- Dr. Strange got his own powers going through the monks,

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:50.570
that had nothing to do with Captain America.

00:03:50.570 --> 00:03:52.260
- True, but he wouldn't be part of the Avengers.

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:53.680
- He don't need to part of the Avengers.

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:55.420
- We're talking about who's the best Avenger!

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:57.310
- Hey, but he could be his own Avenger.

00:03:57.310 --> 00:04:00.600
- Has he been included yet, is he actually an Avenger yet?

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:04.490
- Not yet, but in the comics he is, yo.

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:05.323
- We're not talking about comics,

00:04:05.323 --> 00:04:06.250
we're talking about movies.

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:07.083
- It don't matter!

00:04:07.083 --> 00:04:07.970
- Boom!
(dramatic banging)

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:10.560
- Very, very strong, impassioned arguments

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:12.560
from you two young men who have way too much

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:13.443
time on your hands.

00:04:13.443 --> 00:04:15.526
- That was a good battle.

00:04:16.294 --> 00:04:18.820
- I like this sportsmanship between you guys,

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:20.383
the rest of you, I'm very disappointed.

00:04:20.383 --> 00:04:21.610
(laughter)

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.810
- So I guess, we need to check with our judges.

00:04:23.810 --> 00:04:25.053
Judges, final answer?

00:04:25.346 --> 00:04:26.320
- There's nothing in your ear.

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:29.810
- So I think, after I've confirmed with the judges

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:34.970
You each will get one sentence

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:37.840
to say why your character is the best Avenger.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:38.873
On my hammer, go!

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:43.250
- T'Challa is a man of the people, for the people,

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:45.313
which creates quality leadership.

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:48.702
- Tony Stark is a mortal man without super powers,

00:04:48.702 --> 00:04:50.540
who could die at any point.

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:53.310
That bravery, that courage, is what makes him

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:55.140
truly special and the best Avenger.

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:58.450
- Captain America is the first Avenger

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:01.650
and he is a captain, he is the only person suited

00:05:01.810 --> 00:05:03.763
to actually lead the Avengers.

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:06.330
- Thor has literally lost everything, his parents,

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:08.363
his siblings, his entire planet,

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:11.720
but he pulls everything together to get Storm Breaker

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:13.943
and literally stab Thanos in the heart.

00:05:13.943 --> 00:05:16.213
- But that doesn't do the job!

00:05:16.251 --> 00:05:18.192
- He is almost did it though

00:05:18.192 --> 00:05:19.672
- That doesn't count!

00:05:19.672 --> 00:05:21.360
- T'Challa is a king.

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:22.260
- He's also a god.

00:05:22.330 --> 00:05:23.400
- Thor is also a king.

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:25.290
- Can I say Captain America fought Nazis?

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:27.660
- Yeah, Captain America fought Nazis,

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:29.360
and I'm Jewish, that's big for me.

00:05:29.380 --> 00:05:30.810
- It's hard to argue with fighting Nazis.

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:31.643
- I mean.

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:35.143
- No one else here fought Nazis.

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:36.150
- Damn straight.

00:05:36.150 --> 00:05:37.500
- No one else fought Nazis.

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:38.870
- Can I make one final point?

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:39.703
- No.

00:05:39.793 --> 00:05:41.309
(arguing, shouting)

00:05:41.309 --> 00:05:42.833
- One sentence, it was one sentence,

00:05:43.726 --> 00:05:45.276
you had more than one sentence!

00:05:45.276 --> 00:05:46.130
- If it was between who's the best Avenger,

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:47.330
he's not an Avenger yet.

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:50.093
- Okay, real time, Black Panther gets his own category,

00:05:50.610 --> 00:05:53.340
so if we're going to be doing it under the guise

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:57.263
of who's the best Avenger, okay,

00:05:57.470 --> 00:06:00.110
then for that, based off of the facts

00:06:00.110 --> 00:06:02.123
that were stated in the debate.

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:03.200
- Really swaying?

00:06:03.303 --> 00:06:05.170
(laughter)

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:06.061
- No, you can't put me up th--

00:06:06.061 --> 00:06:07.686
- You ain't got that sway!

00:06:07.820 --> 00:06:10.400
- Within my body, I am not allowed to say Black Panther

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:13.203
is not the winner, so what I am going to say is

00:06:13.203 --> 00:06:16.283
that Captain America is the best Avenger,

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:18.760
Black Panther is the best Marvel superhero,

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:20.723
and that's where we're going to leave it.

00:06:23.801 --> 00:06:25.670
- I just wanna say, just wanna put this out there,

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:27.259
Toby McGuire is the best Spiderman.

00:06:27.259 --> 00:06:29.426
(yelling)

